*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 42.67~46.67 seconds<sup>1,280~1,400f</sup>.
*5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 65.33~68 seconds<sup>1,960~2,040f</sup>.

